            "review_title": "Review at Rasoi Garden Resturant",
            "review_text": "Neha Mathuria\nMumbai, India40 contributions\n0\nDelightful Pure Veg Indian at Rasoi in Da Nang\nDec 2025 • Couples\nWe stopped by Rasoi Indian Pure Veg Restaurant in Da Nang craving authentic vegetarian flavors, and it delivered with its cozy vibe and friendly staff right from the entrance. The menu impressed with pure vegetarian delights like paneer curries, garlic naan, dal tadka and flavorful veggie biryanis that hit all the spicy notes perfectly. Portions were generous, everything arrived fresh and aromatic, ideal for vegetarians seeking home-style Indian food abroad.\nService was attentive and warm, with our server Sahil bringing great hospitality that made the evening special.\nHighly recommend Rasoi for pure veg Indian cuisine in Da Nang.\nRead more\nWritten December 17, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
