            "review_title": "Review at Rasoi Garden Resturant",
            "review_text": "Amit Kale\n3 contributions\n0\nDon’t go to this restaurant. Very rude people, poor service and bad food.\nDec 2022 • Couples\nWe arrived around 8.15pm and were served food that we did not order at 9pm. We requested for our food and after it had not arrived by 920, we walked up to the owner to talk to him. The owner raised his palm to my wife’s face as she was speaking, and said he only would talk to me. After this unbelievable display of micro aggression and in built misogyny, the food that arrived was also unbelievably disappointing. We ordered chicken seek which was dry, paneer manchurian which was ok, butter naan which was VERY thick, and rogan josh, in which the flavours were well balanced but the meat wasn’t cooked fully. Moreover, the staff didn’t know anything. We asked if we could pay by card before sitting down, they said yes, then during payment they said no. We asked for water about 5 times before getting one bottle, then another 5 for the next. We asked how many pieces does one butter naan have, they said 4 and sent 2. Overall, the best thing about rasoi garden is that I never have to go back again\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 9, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
