            "review_title": "Review at Rasoi Garden Resturant",
            "review_text": "Venture827856\n3 contributions\n0\nAvoid, especially if you are a woman\nDec 2022 • Couples\nExperienced delay, rudeness, and yes, blatant sexism in one sitting. Arrived and were seated immediately, given menus. It was all downhill from there. 20 minutes later, we got the wrong order of one dish. No other dish came. 50 minutes later, still no food at all had come. My husband and I went to talk to the manager, who - get this - held up his HAND to my FACE, said my husband speaking was enough. When the food came it was still too late, and moreover it was average. Getting water also required multiple requests. There are many Indian restaurants in danang, please avoid this one.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 9, 2022",
