            "review_title": "Review at Rasoi Garden Resturant",
            "review_text": "Algol4ever\nAmsterdam, The Netherlands6 contributions\n0\nAmazing food! Great service!\nMay 2021\nI have now had Rasoi Garden twice during this current covid shutdown. They have just opened up in My An so the interior of the place ,as of this writing, still has quite a bit of work to do but you can see the potential of a unique , fun place to eat in the future. Since it's takeout rules only right now, it's all about the service and the food. I must say both are excellent. Highly recommeneded.\nRead more\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 24, 2021",
